          "heading": "next_steps",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.7",
            "sections.8"
          ],
          "text": "- A community midwife will visit you at home to continue your care.\n- Your GP and health visitor have been told about your stay.\n- You have a postnatal check booked with your GP at 6 weeks."
        },
